---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About — Yitae Jeong">
  <div class="max-w-2xl">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs text-cyan-700 dark:text-cyan-400 mb-2">ABOUT</p>
    <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-zinc-950 dark:text-white mb-6">Yitae Jeong (tteon)</h1>

    <div class="prose-custom">
      <p>
        I work at <strong>XCENA</strong> in Seoul, exploring how graph databases, explicit ontologies, and LLM inference infrastructure (vLLM, KV-cache, CXL/RDMA) fit together under real production constraints.
      </p>

      <h2>How This Lab Log Works</h2>
      <p>
        Rather than hiding experiment outputs inside private folders or cherry-picking wins, every experiment entry published here is backed by raw run artifacts, commit hashes, and pre-registered hypotheses:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Supported</strong>: Measured outcomes satisfy pre-registered criteria without confounding failures.</li>
        <li><strong>Refuted</strong>: Hypothesis failed under valid execution conditions.</li>
        <li><strong>Mixed</strong>: Gains in one workload tier or dimension alongside regressions in another.</li>
        <li><strong>Inconclusive</strong>: Execution failed or lacked baseline parity (failures are never disguised as rejections or passes).</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Links</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>GitHub: <a href="https://github.com/tteon" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">github.com/tteon</a></li>
        <li>LinkedIn: <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/yitaejeong/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">linkedin.com/in/yitaejeong</a></li>
        <li>SEOCHO Documentation: <a href="https://seocho.blog" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">seocho.blog</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
